jobs.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Muck Rack is trusted by thousands of organizations around the world to understand how their brands show up across news, social media and AI-generated answers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our AI-powered platform connects the entire PR workflow in one place, helping communications teams manage media relationships, understand the conversations shaping their brands, take action and measure their impact. Combined with analyst-led Media Intelligence and advisory services, Muck Rack turns signals into insights and insights into action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founder-controlled and growing&amp;nbsp; profitably and sustainably, we have the freedom to build forward-thinking products, put our customers first, and offer an inclusive culture that welcomes diverse perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a collaborative, self-motivated &lt;strong&gt;Analytics Architect&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Business Data Analytics team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the VP, Analytics, you’ll serve as the lead architect for Business Data Analytics, defining and driving an AI-first data and analytics architecture that modernizes our analytics platform and enables new ways for teams to access and interact with data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll establish the technical blueprint for a modern data analytics stack supporting Data Ingestion to Snowflake / Databricks, Data Modeling / Semantic Layers (dbt, Python, SQL), Natural Language Analytics (Agents), Data Activation (rETL, System to System), and Self-Service Analytics (BI Tools). You’ll collaborate across Data Science, Engineering, Product, and Revenue Operations to establish scalable architecture, integration patterns, governance, and engineering practices that enable trusted data and AI-powered analyticsacross the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1wajri6&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;17&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;19&quot; data-end=&quot;1274&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ec3pjh&quot; data-start=&quot;19&quot; data-end=&quot;234&quot;&gt;Define and drive the target architecture for an AI-first enterprise data and analytics platform, establishing the technical direction and patterns needed to modernize and consolidate the analytics technology stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cboc1o&quot; data-start=&quot;235&quot; data-end=&quot;426&quot;&gt;Architect scalable data infrastructure, ingestion and transformation frameworks, storage models, and integration patterns across Snowflake, Databricks, dbt, Python, SQL, and related systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c9bmhp&quot; data-start=&quot;427&quot; data-end=&quot;603&quot;&gt;Design governed semantic data layers and the supporting architecture for AI agents, natural language querying, conversational analytics, and other AI-powered data experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1axrmos&quot; data-start=&quot;604&quot; data-end=&quot;789&quot;&gt;Establish architecture patterns for retrieval, APIs, and integrations that allow AI agents and applications to securely discover, understand, and interact with trusted enterprise data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11sqcuo&quot; data-start=&quot;790&quot; data-end=&quot;969&quot;&gt;Lead the evolution of data governance, security, privacy, access control, and compliance patterns across the analytics stack, balancing accessibility with appropriate safeguards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sh29w7&quot; data-start=&quot;970&quot; data-end=&quot;1189&quot;&gt;Establish and champion engineering standards for data modeling, testing, observability, CI/CD, documentation, deployment, and system integration, improving the reliability and maintainability of the analytics platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lkzodo&quot; data-start=&quot;1190&quot; data-end=&quot;1274&quot;&gt;Provide technical leadership and mentorship to the Analytics Engineers on the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;13mqv4e&quot; data-start=&quot;1276&quot; data-end=&quot;1337&quot;&gt;To Be Set Up for Success in This Role, You’ll Need to Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1339&quot; data-end=&quot;2785&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;a4wai&quot; data-start=&quot;1339&quot; data-end=&quot;1537&quot;&gt;7+ years of experience designing and evolving modern data and analytics architectures, including responsibility for architectural decisions that span multiple systems, teams, or business use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1reaee2&quot; data-start=&quot;1538&quot; data-end=&quot;1679&quot;&gt;Deep experience with modern cloud data platforms and analytics engineering practices, including Snowflake, Databricks, dbt, Python, and SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pyk56y&quot; data-start=&quot;1680&quot; data-end=&quot;1846&quot;&gt;Experience designing scalable data models, transformation pipelines, semantic or metrics layers, and integration patterns that enable trusted self-service analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;158c2g2&quot; data-start=&quot;1847&quot; data-end=&quot;2051&quot;&gt;Experience architecting or implementing AI-enabled data systems, such as natural language analytics, AI agents, Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), vector search, or related LLM-powered data workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fapo7p&quot; data-start=&quot;2052&quot; data-end=&quot;2249&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of enterprise data governance, security, privacy, access control, and data quality practices, with experience translating those requirements into practical technical architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1k8ih9w&quot; data-start=&quot;2250&quot; data-end=&quot;2427&quot;&gt;Experience establishing engineering practices such as automated testing, CI/CD, observability, version control, and reliable deployment patterns for data and analytics systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wc7g07&quot; data-start=&quot;2428&quot; data-end=&quot;2594&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to set technical direction, evaluate complex architectural trade-offs, and influence decisions across teams without relying on direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hqq58h&quot; data-start=&quot;2595&quot; data-end=&quot;2785&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to translate complex data and AI architecture into clear decisions, standards, and technical direction for both technical and business partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1uc83hl&quot; data-start=&quot;2787&quot; data-end=&quot;2866&quot;&gt;If Any of the Below Also Describe You, This Could Be an Exciting Opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2868&quot; data-end=&quot;3662&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sdnarm&quot; data-start=&quot;2868&quot; data-end=&quot;2986&quot;&gt;You’ve helped modernize or consolidate a fragmented enterprise data ecosystem into a more cohesive modern data stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1y0m64y&quot; data-start=&quot;2987&quot; data-end=&quot;3109&quot;&gt;You’ve designed semantic or metrics layers specifically to support AI-powered, conversational, or self-service analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11sq7yu&quot; data-start=&quot;3110&quot; data-end=&quot;3231&quot;&gt;You have experience taking AI agents or RAG-based data applications from architecture through production implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pn9vcs&quot; data-start=&quot;3232&quot; data-end=&quot;3375&quot;&gt;You’ve developed reusable frameworks, standards, or platform capabilities that increased the effectiveness of analytics and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;tc7iae&quot; data-start=&quot;3376&quot; data-end=&quot;3481&quot;&gt;You enjoy mentoring engineers and raising technical standards while remaining an individual contributor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8naseb&quot; data-start=&quot;3482&quot; data-end=&quot;3662&quot;&gt;You’re comfortable operating in ambiguous technical environments where the architecture is still being defined and your decisions will influence how teams build for years to come&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;18m3jj1&quot; data-start=&quot;3664&quot; data-end=&quot;3719&quot;&gt;In Addition, We’re Always Looking for Candidates Who&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3721&quot; data-end=&quot;4426&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mk31jt&quot; data-start=&quot;3721&quot; data-end=&quot;3869&quot;&gt;Approach architecture pragmatically, balancing immediate business needs with scalability, maintainability, security, and long-term platform health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ejz93l&quot; data-start=&quot;3870&quot; data-end=&quot;3991&quot;&gt;Build alignment across technical and non-technical teams and communicate architectural decisions and trade-offs clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8o5u0f&quot; data-start=&quot;3992&quot; data-end=&quot;4093&quot;&gt;Take ownership of ambiguous, complex problems and create clarity and actionable technical direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1e8jacw&quot; data-start=&quot;4094&quot; data-end=&quot;4217&quot;&gt;Look for opportunities to create reusable systems, standards, and patterns that increase the effectiveness of other teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dv1bhl&quot; data-start=&quot;4218&quot; data-end=&quot;4322&quot;&gt;Share knowledge generously and mentor teammates through complex technical and architectural challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8jbfxw&quot; data-start=&quot;4323&quot; data-end=&quot;4426&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Proactively incorporate AI tools into day-to-day work to improve productivity and accelerate delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Below you&#39;ll find an outline of the interview plan for this role. Please note that this is what we expect the process to look like; we may ask you for supplemental information or require an additional step before making a final decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 min interview with a member of our Talent Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 1 hour zoom interview with the hiring manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peer interviews with several team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills Assessment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive interviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute Bar Raiser&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel &amp;amp; Team Engagement Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires up to 10% travel for team collaboration, customer engagements, and company events. As part of our commitment to building strong connections across our fully distributed team, attendance at our annual company offsite (typically held in Mexico) is expected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;108&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role in Ireland is €110,000–€130,000 annually, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;110&quot; data-end=&quot;211&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary for this role in United Kingdom is £130,000–£150,000, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual compensation decisions are based on a number of factors, including experience level, skillset, and balancing internal equity relative to peers at the company. We expect the majority of the candidates who are offered roles at our company to fall healthily throughout the range based on these factors. We recognize that the person we hire may be less experienced (or more senior) than this job description as posted. If that ends up being the case, the updated salary range will be communicated with you as a candidate.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Muck Rack?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote Work, Forever&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully distributed team with a permanent remote setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office stipend, phone and internet reimbursement, coworking membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtual and in-person team bonding (lunches, events, competitions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent &amp;amp; Fair Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive geo-neutral pay in the U.S.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual reviews to ensure equity and market alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardized bonus or commission structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with employer contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive medical, dental, vision, disability, and life insurance for employees and dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% premium coverage for individuals on high-deductible plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 Virtual Care and Employee Assistance Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-funded HSA contributions and other pre-tax benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterly wellness stipend and free Headspace subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Family Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;4+ weeks of PTO, plus paid sick and mental health days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;13 paid holidays with the option to swap for personal days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 16 weeks of fully paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning and Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transparent pathways for internal mobility and promotion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bi-annual performance reviews, team workshops, and leadership training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited access to Coursera and O’Reilly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 additional PTO days annually for learning and development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusive, Customer-First Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to equity and valuing diverse perspectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile, founder-led company focused on collaboration and innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted by 3,000+ companies worldwide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Note: Benefits and compensation reflect offerings for U.S.-based employees. Support is provided for employees in other locations, in compliance with local laws and regulations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we are a fully distributed team, we do have limitations on where we can hire and maintain a list of acceptable working locations based on job function. If we are unable to hire in your current location for the role for which you applied, you will be notified via email. While we enjoy many benefits as a permanently distributed and remote company, we cannot always support relocation or extended travel and have guidelines in place to ensure compliant work away from your designated permanent residence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__gutter&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__gutter__right&quot; data-qa=&quot;message_content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer&quot; data-qa=&quot;block-kit-renderer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;Please note: For detailed information regarding our GDPR and/or CCPA compliance policies, including how we handle personal data and privacy rights, kindly refer to the email correspondence accompanying this application.&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;h6 class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Muck Rack does not accept unsolicited resumes from search firms or any other third parties. Any unsolicited resume sent to Muck Rack will be considered Muck Rack property, and Muck Rack will not pay a fee should it hire the subject of any unsolicited resume.&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;h6 class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Muck Rack considers applicants for all positions on the basis of merit, qualifications, and business needs, and without regard to race, color, national origin, religion, sex, age, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, alienage or citizenship status, ancestry, marital status, genetic predisposition or carrier status, veteran status, familial status, status as a victim of domestic violence, or any other status or characteristic protected by applicable federal, state, or local law.&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;Note to applicants/job seekers: We have recently been made aware of scams impersonating Muck Rack’s HR team. Please be cautious of these attempts to elicit banking or other financial or sensitive information. Muck Rack will never request financial information during the interview process, and follow ups for interviews or next steps will always come from an ----- email address. If you are contacted by anyone from a different domain who claims to be from Muck Rack, please forward the communication to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot; ----- -----
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role in Our Story:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;As a Senior Recruiter at ACT, you will attract and hire commercial talent, primarily -and not alone- for our Front Office teams. You will manage the recruitment process from intake to offer, working closely with hiring managers to understand their business, challenge requirements and turn hiring needs into effective recruitment strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You understand our markets and what motivates people working in environmental commodities, energy and trading. You use this knowledge to identify talent, build relationships and give practical advice on how to attract the right candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the full recruitment cycle, primarily for Front Office positions, including sales, trading and business development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with hiring managers to define role requirements, agree on selection criteria and keep recruitment moving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proactively source and engage candidates, building talent pipelines for current and future hiring needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring market knowledge into hiring discussions, advising on talent availability, competitor activity and candidate expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct thorough interviews and support objective, consistent hiring decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliver a positive candidate experience through clear communication, timely feedback and careful follow-up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Keep Greenhouse accurate and up to date, using recruitment data to identify bottlenecks and improve results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with fellow recruiters, HR and Employer Branding, sharing knowledge and contributing to team priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be successful in this role, we are looking for candidates with the following qualifications and attributes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3–5 years of recruitment experience, with a strong track record of hiring for commercial or Front Office positions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of environmental commodities, energy, trading or closely related financial and commodity markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong sourcing skills and experience engaging passive candidates in competitive international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Confidence working with hiring managers, offering practical advice and respectfully challenging assumptions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An eager, proactive approach: you take initiative, spot opportunities and follow through.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A collaborative mindset: you share insights, support colleagues and take responsibility for team results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong organisational skills, with the ability to manage several vacancies and changing priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience using an ATS, preferably Greenhouse, and an interest in applying recruitment technology and AI effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication skills in English and the ability to connect with people across different cultures and backgrounds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet these criteria and are ready to contribute your expertise to a dynamic and challenging environment, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About THG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our portfolio of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Role: Senior Trading Manager&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand: Myprotein&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to: Ecommerce Director&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: THG ICON 1, 7-9 Sunbank Lane, WA15 0AF (Fully Office Based)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;As Senior Trading Manager for the UK, you will own the commercial performance of Myprotein&#39;s UK website, driving profitable growth through effective ecommerce trading, customer experience and onsite optimisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will set the UK ecommerce strategy, translating commercial objectives and customer insight into clear trading priorities. Combining strong commercial judgement with data-led decision-making, you will identify opportunities, drive performance and lead cross-functional teams to deliver growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Details&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own UK website performance across revenue, traffic, conversion, AOV, margin and profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and deliver the UK ecommerce trading strategy, translating business targets into clear priorities and action plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive onsite trading and optimisation across merchandising, navigation, search, landing pages and promotional activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage pricing and promotional investment, balancing revenue growth, margin and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead forecasting and performance reviews, identifying risks, opportunities and actions to maximise trading performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer insight, competitor activity and market trends to inform commercial decisions and identify growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing, CRM, Brand, Product, UX, Technology, Supply Chain and Finance to deliver the UK growth agenda.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive improvements across the customer journey, increasing conversion, basket size, retention and customer lifetime value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead testing and optimisation initiatives, using clear hypotheses and measurable commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion AI, automation and analytics to improve decision-making, efficiency and trading effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence senior stakeholders and hold cross-functional teams accountable for delivering commercial priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in ecommerce, digital trading or online retail, ideally within a fast-paced DTC or consumer business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of owning website performance and delivering profitable commercial growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of ecommerce trading metrics, including revenue, conversion, AOV, margin and customer lifetime value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and executing trading strategies and onsite optimisation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial judgement, with the ability to balance growth, profitability and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical and data-driven, able to turn insight into clear commercial actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and autonomous, with a strong bias for action and personal accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence senior stakeholders and lead cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in testing, optimisation and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident using BI and ecommerce analytics tools, with an interest in leveraging AI and automation to improve performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communicator, comfortable challenging thinking and driving decisions at pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What’s in It for Me?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Career Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Access bespoke development programmes designed by our in-house Learning &amp;amp; Development team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop your expertise through our upskilling programme, delivered in partnership with an industry-leading training provider.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Enhanced Leave&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;25 days’ annual leave plus bank holidays.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enjoy your birthday off, on us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enhanced maternity and paternity pay, depending on length of service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Up to 10 days’ compassionate leave.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Option to buy up to 3 additional days of annual leave each year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unlock 2 days of volunteer leave after 12 months.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Wellbeing Support&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Access face-to-face and virtual appointments with our in-house GP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Access our 24/7 Employee Assistance Programme, provided by Bupa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;State-of-the-art on-site gym.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Access to our on-site physiotherapist.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Other Perks&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Save up to 12% on personal tech through our salary sacrifice scheme.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Subsidised bus pass from Manchester City Centre to our ICON office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Up to 50% staff discount on THG brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On-site staff shop and barber.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Refer someone to THG and receive up to £1,000 when they pass their probation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anniversary gifts when you reach 5 and 10 years of service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunities employer and welcome applications from people of all backgrounds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is committed to creating a diverse &amp;amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven&#39;t heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG please contact one of our &lt;span class=&quot;mark75xs2u5gf&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;Talent&lt;/span&gt; team to discuss further.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About THG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our portfolio of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role: Senior Events Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand / Area: Myprotein&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to: Head of Social Media&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: THG ICON 1, 7-9 Sunbank Lane, WA15 0AF (Fully Office Based)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at THG Nutrition&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;353&quot; data-end=&quot;578&quot;&gt;THG Nutrition is home to some of the world’s most trusted and best-loved wellbeing and nutrition brands, including Myprotein, the world’s largest online sports nutrition brand, alongside Myvegan, Myvitamins and MP Activewear.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;580&quot; data-end=&quot;776&quot;&gt;Our brands and people exist to break boundaries — to power and empower those who want more. We move fast, challenge convention, and back ourselves to win. These values shape how we work every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;580&quot; data-end=&quot;776&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;580&quot; data-end=&quot;776&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to hire a Senior Events Manager to join our Brand Marketing team at Myprotein, the world’s largest online sports nutrition brand. In this senior role, you’ll take ownership of our end-to-end events strategy – leading a dynamic events calendar from concept through delivery, managing and developing a team of event professionals, and setting the standard for high-impact, brand-defining activations. With a strong focus on B2B and influencer-led events, you’ll build and maintain relationships with senior industry partners, stakeholders, and clients, shaping how the brand shows up at every touchpoint. You’ll partner closely with senior leadership, internal teams, and external partners to translate business objectives into bold event concepts delivered at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Events and Activations strategy &amp;amp; calendar ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team leadership, coaching &amp;amp; development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget ownership per activation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior stakeholder &amp;amp; leadership engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplier &amp;amp; vendor negotiation at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B2B &amp;amp; flagship event execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-site event leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speaker, talent &amp;amp; influencer partnerships (in collaboration with the influencer team)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brand direction for event materials &amp;amp; creative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-market event roll-out&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Logistics, scheduling &amp;amp; risk management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permits, compliance &amp;amp; health and safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Post-event reporting, ROI analysis &amp;amp; insight sharing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For your Skills, Knowledge and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Events Manager who leads from the front – someone who thrives under pressure, is energised by a fast-paced environment, and brings both strategic thinking and hands-on delivery to everything they do. You’ll have a sharp eye for industry trends, a track record of developing others, and the confidence to represent the brand in front of senior stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: 5 years of event management experience, including experience operating at a senior or leadership level, ideally within a brand marketing, retail, or corporate environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brand Events: Proven track record delivering large-scale, influencer-focused and PR-driven events (e.g. global brand launches, PR previews, creator activations) end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project Management: Proven ability to manage multiple complex, high-profile events simultaneously, from concept to execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Management: Confident operating with senior stakeholders, internal teams, external partners, and vendors, including at exec level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budgeting &amp;amp; Negotiation: Extensive experience owning event budgets, negotiating high-value contracts, and securing cost-effective, high-quality solutions. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Leadership: Proven experience leading, developing, and mentoring an events team, delegating effectively and overseeing event staff or external agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Planning: Experience shaping and owning an events strategy that ties directly to broader marketing and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Crisis &amp;amp; Risk Management: Comfortable managing risk, compliance, and on-the-day issues under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;580&quot; data-end=&quot;776&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
