&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Global Field Marketing Organization&lt;/strong&gt; drives market penetration, customer engagement, and pipeline generation across key regions in the Americas, EMEA, and APAC. The team owns regional go-to-market strategy and execution — high-touch account-based marketing, field programs, third-party conferences, executive engagement, and partner-led motions — and works cross-functionally with Sales, Product Marketing, Events, Brand, and Demand to drive customer acquisition and expansion across enterprise and AI-native accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Director of EMEA Field Marketing&lt;/strong&gt; to own the customer engagement and pipeline-generation strategy and execution across EMEA, and to establish CoreWeave as a recognized and trusted brand in the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will lead and grow a team of regional marketing managers, and partner closely with sales leadership to align marketing investments and resourcing around the GEO go-to-market strategy supporting customer acquisition and customer expansion across enterprise and AI-natives. As leader of Field Marketing for EMEA, you will play a pivotal role in shaping and executing our regional marketing strategy across high-touch account-based marketing, 3rd party conferences, field programs, executive engagement, and partner-led motions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will own how CoreWeave shows up in the region — building awareness and credibility with European AI-native builders and enterprise buyers, and adapting the global brand narrative for a market with distinct data sovereignty, regulatory, language, and cultural requirements. Your leadership will drive the expansion of CoreWeave&#39;s presence and reputation in the dynamic and rapidly evolving EMEA AI-Cloud market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success is measured by pipeline created and progressed, conversion rates across the funnel, deal velocity in priority accounts, and growth in regional brand awareness and consideration among target accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Strategy &amp;amp; Pipeline Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the EMEA customer engagement and pipeline-generation strategy end to end, carrying accountability for sourced and influenced pipeline targets by segment, country, and priority account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align marketing investment and team resourcing to the GEO go-to-market strategy, ensuring the regional plan reflects where Sales is prioritizing acquisition and expansion across enterprise and AI-native accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance investment between near-term pipeline generation and the brand and category-building work required to make CoreWeave a known quantity in EMEA, and be able to articulate the tradeoff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the channel mix across ABM, field programs, third-party conferences, executive engagement, and partner-led motions based on ROI analysis and attribution data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build distinct motions for acquisition and expansion: net-new account penetration and category presence on one side, deeper multi-workload engagement within existing customers on the other.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize across a multi-country region — sequencing investment across core markets and emerging ones rather than spreading coverage thin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a multi-million dollar regional budget with explicit ROI rationale, and defend allocation and resourcing decisions to marketing and sales leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand Presence &amp;amp; Market Development in EMEA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own CoreWeave&#39;s overall brand presence in EMEA — partnering with the Brand, Communications, and Product Marketing teams to build awareness, credibility, and consideration in a market where CoreWeave is still establishing itself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt the global brand narrative for regional realities: data sovereignty and residency, EU regulatory context, local infrastructure footprint, language and cultural nuance — without fragmenting the global story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Land regional proof points — customer stories, local infrastructure milestones, partner wins — and make them visible in-market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Partnership &amp;amp; Account-Based Marketing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the senior marketing partner to EMEA sales leadership — in pipeline reviews, account planning, and forecast discussions — translating GEO priorities into funded, resourced programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct high-touch ABM against CoreWeave&#39;s priority AI-native and enterprise accounts, partnering with Sales to define coverage, nomination criteria, and progression goals at the account and contact level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive disciplined lead and opportunity handoff with Sales and SDR, with agreed SLAs, shared quality definitions, and acceleration plays for stalled or late-stage deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build expansion programs alongside Sales and Customer teams that deepen engagement in existing accounts and surface new workloads, teams, and buying centers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Presence &amp;amp; Executive Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand CoreWeave&#39;s presence across the EMEA AI-Cloud market, selecting the third-party conferences, field programs, and technical and developer-led moments where CoreWeave should show up — and holding each to a pipeline and brand thesis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Executive Marketing team to connect regional CXO and VP engagement to opportunity progression in named accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Partner Marketing to activate partner-led motions in-region — including the regional systems integrators, resellers, and cloud and ecosystem partners that carry disproportionate weight in EMEA — turning joint narratives into named-account plays and co-sell pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear regional input into global campaigns and launches so they land effectively with EMEA audiences and buyer personas, and flag where regional adaptation is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Developer Marketing to grow developer advocacy and engagement with in EMEA communities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Optimization &amp;amp; Scalable Systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the KPIs that matter — account and contact coverage, engagement, meetings, sourced and influenced pipeline, conversion rates and stage progression — in Salesforce and the marketing automation and ABM stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish testing and optimization frameworks across messaging, audience, channel, and offer: hypothesis, test, measure, then scale or retire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the repeatable systems that make regional growth predictable — program briefs and business cases, target account and contact selection, program templates, and playbooks any country team can run.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing Operations and Revenue Operations on attribution, lead scoring, and reporting so regional investment ties cleanly to revenue outcomes, and deliver post-program reporting that drives explicit go/no-go decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within EMEA data privacy and consent requirements (GDPR and local equivalents), partnering with Legal and Marketing Ops to keep regional data practices compliant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team of regional marketing managers, hiring to plan as the EMEA team scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a team of pipeline-focused field marketers who understand the full customer journey, the sales process, and their own revenue impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear ownership boundaries and escalation paths so the team coordinates with Events, Brand, Partner Marketing, and Demand Gen rather than absorbing their scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent EMEA performance and plans in global marketing forums, and partner with Americas and APAC counterparts on global initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced regional marketing leader:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years in B2B marketing at high-growth technology or enterprise companies, with direct pipeline accountability across field marketing, demand generation, or ABM supporting EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People leader:&lt;/strong&gt; 4+ years leading regional or field marketing teams with pipeline accountability, including hiring and developing marketers across a distributed, multi-country geography.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand builder in-region:&lt;/strong&gt; Track record establishing or scaling a brand in EMEA for a company earlier in its regional journey — building awareness and credibility from a low base, and adapting a global narrative to local market realities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EMEA market fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the region&#39;s diversity — buying behavior, language and cultural differences, data sovereignty and regulatory considerations, and the partner and ecosystem landscape across core and emerging markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales-aligned operator:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience partnering directly with executive sales leadership to shape GEO go-to-market plans, and allocating marketing investment and headcount against territory and account priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account- and deal-centric:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong grasp of complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise personas and how ABM, executive engagement, and field programs influence acquisition, expansion, and close rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data and analytics depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced proficiency with pipeline attribution, conversion analysis, and ROI optimization using Salesforce, Tableau and ABM platforms, and BI tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program range:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to build across the full regional mix — ABM, third-party conferences, field programs, executive experiences, brand and community moments, and partner co-marketing — with clear evidence of impact from each.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-curious:&lt;/strong&gt; Genuinely interested in AI infrastructure and how AI-native and enterprise customers build and scale workloads, with the ability to ramp quickly on CoreWeave&#39;s platform and market to CTOs, CIOs, VPs of Engineering, and AI/ML leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel across the region as programs require.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The starting salary will be determined by job-related knowledge, skills, experience, and the market location. We strive for both market alignment and internal equity when determining compensation. In addition to base salary, our total rewards package includes a discretionary bonus, equity awards, and a comprehensive benefits program (all based on eligibility).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To fulfill our obligation to protect client data, successful applicants offered employment with CoreWeave will be required to complete a basic criminal record check, conducted in compliance with GDPR. Employment offers are conditional upon receiving satisfactory check results.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, we offer a variety of benefits to support your needs, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-level Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-level Dental Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Pension Contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance at 4x Salary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical Illness Cover&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Programme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work culture focused on innovative disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits may vary by location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CoreWeave is an equal opportunity employer, committed to fostering an inclusive and supportive workplace. All qualified applicants and candidates will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, disability, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Agencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;CoreWeave does not accept speculative CVs. Any unsolicited CVs received will be treated as the property of CoreWeave and your Terms &amp;amp; Conditions associated with the use of CVs will be considered null and void.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Any unsolicited CVs sent by your company to us – that is to say, in any situation where we have not directly engaged your company in writing to supply candidates for a specific vacancy – will be considered by us to be a “free gift”, leaving us liable for no fees whatsoever should we choose to contact the candidate directly and engage the candidate’s services, and will in no way establish any prior claim by your company to representation of that candidate should the candidate’s details also be submitted by any other party.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires access to export controlled information. &amp;nbsp;To conform to U.S. Government export regulations applicable to that information, applicant must either be (A) a U.S. person, defined as a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful permanent resident (green card holder), (iii) refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, (B) eligible to access the export controlled information without a required export authorization, or (C) eligible and reasonably likely to obtain the required export authorization from the applicable U.S. government agency. &amp;nbsp;CoreWeave may, for legitimate business reasons, decline to pursue any export licensing process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Updated privacy notice - UK and EU Job Applications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;When you apply to a job on this site, the personal data contained in your application will be collected by CoreWeave UK Ltd. (“Controller”), which is located at&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Phosphor (6th Floor), 133 Park Street, London, SE1 9EA&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;and can be contacted by emailing ----- Controller’s data protection officer can be contacted at ----- Your personal data will be processed for the purposes of managing Controller’s recruitment related activities, which include setting up and conducting interviews and tests for applicants, evaluating and assessing the results thereto, and as is otherwise needed in the recruitment and hiring processes. Such processing is legally permissible under Art. 6(1)(f) of (i) Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (General Data Protection Regulation (“GDPR”) and (ii) the GDPR as it forms part of the laws of the UK (“UK GDPR”), as necessary for the purposes of the legitimate interests pursued by the Controller, which are the solicitation, evaluation, and selection of applicants for employment. Your personal data will be shared with Greenhouse Software, Inc., a cloud services provider located in the United States of America and engaged by Controller to help manage its recruitment and hiring process on Controller’s behalf. With respect to transfers originating from the UK or the European Economic Area (&quot;EEA&quot;) to a country outside the UK or the EEA, we implement the appropriate transfer mechanism(s) and other appropriate solutions to address cross-border transfers as required by applicable law. You may request a copy of the suitable mechanisms we have in place by contacting us at &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Controller as long as Controller determines it is necessary to evaluate your application for employment. Where permitted by applicable law, we may also retain your personal data for a limited period after the recruitment process ends in order to consider you for future job opportunities, respond to legal claims, or comply with record-keeping obligations. Under the GDPR and the UK GDPR, you have the right to request access to your personal data, to request that your personal data be rectified or erased, and to request that processing of your personal data be restricted. You also have the right to data portability. In addition, you may lodge a complaint with the relevant supervisory authority: (i) A list of Europe’s data protection authorities can be found &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://ec.europa.eu/justice/article-29/structure/data-protection-authorities/index_en.htm__;!!I6uDfDBXfA!zaqvpaXitCAqve4cpmPGknjMlTsgIw8w_6xTVeiRpNP5Eo6Ajz9ZkXAYM2uL-nlD8kD6Ndd-Oe-k_BEQQh9xVQGfFw$&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;; and (ii) for the UK, this is the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://ico.org.uk/__;!!I6uDfDBXfA!zaqvpaXitCAqve4cpmPGknjMlTsgIw8w_6xTVeiRpNP5Eo6Ajz9ZkXAYM2uL-nlD8kD6Ndd-Oe-k_BEQQh9IDhJOUA$&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Information Commissioner&#39;s Office&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For additional information, please see our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.coreweave.com/docs/policies/terms-of-service/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;description content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/&quot;&gt;Thoughtworks&lt;/a&gt; is a global technology consultancy that integrates design, engineering and AI to drive digital innovation. We are over 10,000 people strong across 47 offices in 18 countries. For 30+ years, we’ve delivered extraordinary impact together with our clients by helping them solve complex business problems with technology and culture as the differentiator.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thoughtworks.com is one of our most important customer-facing products, helping clients discover our expertise, explore evidence of our impact and take the next step with us. It also helps job seekers explore opportunities and gives search engines and AI assistants an accurate, trusted understanding of who we are and what we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, fragmented ownership across Marketing limits our ability to deliver connected customer journeys, maintain consistent quality and continuously improve performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Head of Product Design to change that. You’ll lead Thoughtworks.com as a digital product, translating our go-to-market and employer brand strategies into seamless experiences for customers, job seekers and AI agents. You’ll own the website strategy, roadmap, customer journeys, publishing model and content and design quality. You&#39;ll also shape experiences across connected channels, including email through Knak and events through Splash, while influencing the internal workflows that drive quality, consistency and speed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, player-coach role for someone who can think strategically and deliver at every level, from defining roadmaps and improving customer journeys to refining copy, reviewing designs, interpreting performance data and making launch decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-responsibilities&quot;&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-responsibilities content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Website product strategy&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the product vision, principles and roadmap for Thoughtworks.com&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize work around customer and business outcomes rather than requests for individual pages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect the website roadmap to Thoughtworks’ go-to-market priorities, propositions and major company launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer journeys and experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a deep understanding of our audiences, including enterprise buyers, technology leaders, practitioners, partners, prospective employees and alumni community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design connected journeys that help people move from a question/problem/need to relevant services, expertise, evidence and action, where the site fuels journeys on AI platforms that might never have users interact with our site&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer research, website data and market insight to identify friction and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the core website, event pages and email experiences work together where they form part of the same journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Narrative, copy and content quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the quality and coherence of the website narrative, copy and information architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex technology services and Thoughtworks expertise into clear, credible experiences for different audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge unclear propositions, duplicated content, unsupported claims and pages that do not serve a defined customer need&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the central Content team, service-line marketers and subject-matter experts, while keeping accountability for how content works within the overall experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with content operations to establish reusable content patterns, editorial standards and clear ownership for maintaining important content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experiences for people and agents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the website is useful and understandable to human visitors, search engines and AI assistants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the SEO and LLM Discoverability Lead to improve how Thoughtworks is found, interpreted and represented to support buyers in their decision making process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape requirements for structured content, metadata, evidence, content relationships and reusable information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance machine readability with strong human storytelling, accessibility and brand expression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Publishing model for the AI era&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the spec for redesigning the publishing workflow from brief through design, production, approval, release and ongoing improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the GTM tech and Global IT teams to replace manual, error-prone production with reusable patterns, clearer decision rights and proportionate automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify where AI can improve research, prototyping, content preparation, metadata, accessibility checks, quality assurance and content maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn good judgment into practical standards, templates, playbooks and automated checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a model that allows teams to move faster without lowering the quality bar or creating uncontrolled publishing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design quality and experimentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the direction and quality bar for UX, UI, interaction design and the website design system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use qualitative and quantitative evidence to improve journeys, messaging and conversion over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sign off on experience quality before major launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team and agency leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a multidisciplinary team spanning product design, experience production, transformation and discoverability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give people clear outcomes, decision rights, constructive feedback and room to do excellent work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build an effective working model with the central Content team, GTM technology, Global IT and service-line marketers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-qualifications&quot;&gt;Job qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-qualifications content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;technical-skills&quot;&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;qualifications inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10 - 15 years experience leading digital products, customer experiences, service design or product design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong record of turning customer insight and business strategy into coherent end-to-end experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent judgment across product, UX, content and design, with the ability to recognize and explain what good looks like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong writing and editorial instincts, including the confidence to simplify complex ideas and challenge unclear copy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with marketing, product, design, engineering and senior business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial understanding and the ability to connect digital experience decisions to go-to-market outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems thinking, including experience creating reusable patterns, design systems, operating models or publishing frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical understanding of search, structured content and how AI assistants discover and interpret information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI tools to improve how work is researched, designed, produced or assured&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to operate in ambiguity, make difficult prioritization decisions and move from strategy to delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of leading and coaching people or multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;professional-skills&quot;&gt;Professional Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;skills inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a natural ability to establish and nurture relationships with senior leaders across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent context-switching capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in situations where you are given little to no direction and have the ability to lead, organize and deliver commitments on time and within budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re resilient in ambiguous situations and can adapt your role to approach challenges from multiple perspectives. You don’t shy away from risks, instead you take them on and skillfully manage them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re empathetic and use this ability to build solid working relationships and resolve issues quickly and thoughtfully&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;important-things&quot;&gt;Other things to know&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;important-things content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no one-size-fits-all career path at Thoughtworks: however you want to develop your career is entirely up to you. But we also balance autonomy with the strength of our cultivation culture. This means your career is supported by interactive tools, numerous development programs and teammates who want to help you grow. We see value in helping each other be our best and that extends to empowering our employees in their career journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;responsible-ai-use&quot;&gt;Responsible Use of AI in Recruitment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;responsible-ai-use content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Thoughtworks, we use AI tools to support our recruitment team with administrative tasks such as drafting communications, scheduling interviews and writing job descriptions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Crucially, our AI tools do not screen, assess, rank or make hiring decisions. Every application is reviewed by our team and all selection decisions are made exclusively by our interviewers and hiring managers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to fairness and responsible AI. We actively manage our AI systems by testing, monitoring for biased outcomes and implementing mitigation measures. We hold our third-party vendors to these same high standards through a rigorous governance process. For additional information, please see our full &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Thoughtworks AI Policy for Recruitment&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about&quot;&gt;About Thoughtworks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;about content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thoughtworks is a dynamic and inclusive community of bright and supportive colleagues who are revolutionizing tech. As a leading technology consultancy, we’re pushing boundaries through our purposeful and impactful work. For 30+ years, we’ve delivered extraordinary impact together with our clients by helping them solve complex business problems with technology as the differentiator. Bring your brilliant expertise and commitment for continuous learning to Thoughtworks. Together, let’s be extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;See here our AI policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our leading SaaS-based Global Employment Platform™ enables clients to expand into over 180 countries quickly and efficiently, without the complexities of establishing local entities. At G-P, we’re dedicated to breaking down barriers to global business and creating opportunities for everyone, everywhere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our diverse, remote-first teams are essential to our success. We empower our Dream Team members with flexibility and resources, fostering an environment where innovation thrives and every contribution is valued and celebrated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The work you do here will positively impact lives around the world. We stand by our promise: Opportunity Made Possible. In addition to competitive compensation and benefits, we invite you to join us in expanding your skills and helping to reshape the future of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At G-P, we assist organizations in building exceptional global teams in days, not months—streamlining the hiring, onboarding, and management process to unlock growth potential for all.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Field Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt;, you will join a high-performing team laser-focused on taking over the market, building a world-class company, and solving the complex international expansion needs of thousands of employers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this full-cycle outbound role, you will lead the charge in driving new logo acquisition across the EMEA region. We are looking for relentless hunters who excel at multi-threaded deal execution, master modern prospecting frameworks, and leverage cutting-edge AI tools to maximize their impact. If you thrive in a fast-paced environment and have a deep desire to win, this is your opportunity to build a high-growth sales career at the recognized leader in Employer of Record (EoR).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Targeted Outbound Prospecting:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute a sophisticated multi-channel prospecting motion (phone, email, social selling, video, etc.) to build a robust, high-quality pipeline across target EMEA accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Threaded Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strategic relationships across prospect organizations—from key operational champions up to economic buyers and C-level executives—aligning our solutions with their top-level business initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver the G-P Value Proposition:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a domain expert on global hiring, articulating the strategic, financial, and operational benefits of G-P as the premier global Employer of Record (EoR) provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Cycle Deal Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead complex sales cycles from initial cold outreach to discovery, solution mapping, commercial proposal generation, objection handling, and deal closure against monthly targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigorously Manage Pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain meticulous pipeline hygiene across all prospect stages, ensuring accurate forecasting and high-quality data management within Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with internal teams—including Sales Engineering, Legal, Marketing, Operations and Customer Success—to align resources, navigate complex deal requirements, and drive revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage AI for Maximum Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Intentionally integrate modern generative AI and sales tech tools into your daily workflow to research accounts, personalize outreach, automate workflows, and increase sales velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Minimum Requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree in Business, Finance, International Relations, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of sales experience, with 3+ years of proven success in a full-cycle, outbound-focused B2B sales role with a track record of consistently meeting or exceeding revenue quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outbound Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ownership of an end-to-end multi-channel prospecting motion, with advanced skills in cold outreach and C-suite engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Methodologies:&lt;/strong&gt; High competency and structured application of modern sales methodologies (e.g., Command of the Message, MEDDPICC, Challenger, Sandler, SPIN).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack &amp;amp; AI Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong proficiency with Salesforce and LinkedIn Sales Navigator. Hands-on experience leveraging modern Generative AI tools to enhance prospecting efficiency and workflow productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of B2B SaaS sales cycles, commercial negotiation, and complex buyer dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Impact Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional written, verbal, and presentation skills, with the ability to command attention, articulate complex value, and build immediate trust over video and phone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Mindset &amp;amp; Drive:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong desire to win, high coachability, a relentless growth mindset, and an authentic curiosity for solving complex customer problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience selling within the HR Tech, Employer of Record (EoR), global payroll, or workforce management ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Intelligence Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with modern revenue intelligence and tech stack tools (e.g., Gong, Clari, Cognism, Outreach).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;message-list_1761669766.039629&quot; class=&quot;c-virtual_list__item&quot; data-qa=&quot;virtual-list-item&quot; data-item-key=&quot;1761669766.039629&quot;&gt;
